2:58.032" end="2:58.914">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的旅程不会结束</span></p><p begin="2:58.914" end="3:01.445" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:58.914" end="2:59.657">Till</span> <span begin="2:59.657" end="2:59.849">I</span> <span begin="2:59.849" end="3:00.284">reach</span> <span begin="3:00.284" end="3:00.492">your</span> <span begin="3:00.492" end="3:01.445">arms</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">直至能与你相拥</span></p><p begin="3:01.445" end="3:05.033" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:01.445" end="3:01.641">A</span> <span begin="3:01.641" end="3:02.183">Madder</span> <span begin="3:02.183" end="3:02.975">there</span> <span begin="3:02.975" end="3:03.202">for</span> <span begin="3:03.202" end="3:05.033">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">并献上一株茜草</span></p></div></body></tt>